# CripOS Startup Sound
# This is a placeholder. In a real CripOS installation, this would be a
# binary WAV file. For development purposes, this text file marks the
# location where the startup sound should be placed.
#
# To add a real sound:
#   1. Place a .wav file at sounds/startup.wav
#   2. Ensure it is short (< 3 seconds) and low-volume
#   3. The sound plays on boot after Plymouth splash
